# The devcontainer build context is the repo root (see .devcontainer/devcontainer.json),
# but the Dockerfile only needs scripts/install_gtest.sh. Everything expensive stays out so
# `docker build` doesn't ship the vendored taproot tree and local build output to the daemon.
.git
northstar-robomaster-project/build
northstar-robomaster-project/taproot
docs/_build
docs/api
docs/doxyoutput
**/*.pyc
